note: DIVERGENCE. cheerio reads @value out of the attribs map, and neither a select nor a
note: textarea has a value ATTRIBUTE, so both read null on this host. In a browser the DOM
note: adapter reads live properties: select@value is the selected option's value ("b") and
note: textarea@value is its text ("hello"). Direction: server null, browser a real string.
note: An input, whose value IS an attribute, agrees on both sides and is included as the control.
